---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="UGC Video Production — OKAD Agency" description="Scale UGC across paid & organic channels with real creators, clear strategy & production designed to drive results.">

  <!-- Hero -->
  <div class="hero">
    <h1>UGC videos for brands, for <em>content / performance</em></h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">Scale UGC across paid & organic channels with real creators, clear strategy & production designed to drive results.</p>
  </div>

  <!-- Feature Cards -->
  <div class="features-grid">
    <div class="feature-card">
      <h3>Real Creators, Real Results</h3>
      <p>We source and manage creators who match your brand voice and audience demographics. No generic influencers &mdash; only authentic content that converts.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-card">
      <h3>Strategy-Led Production</h3>
      <p>Every video starts with a clear brief tied to your campaign goals. We script hooks, structure narratives, and edit for platform-specific performance.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-card">
      <h3>Scale Without Losing Quality</h3>
      <p>From 5 to 50+ videos per month, our production pipeline maintains creative quality while hitting volume targets and tight deadlines.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Campaign Performance Stats -->
  <section class="stats-section">
    <h2 class="section-title">Campaign Performance</h2>
    <div class="stats-grid">
      <div class="stat-card">
        <h2>Organic</h2>
        <div class="stat-tags">
          <span class="stat-tag green">1M+ views</span>
          <span class="stat-tag blue">8% avg. engagement</span>
        </div>
        <p style="color:var(--color-muted);font-size:15px;margin-top:12px;">UGC content that performs across TikTok, Instagram Reels, and YouTube Shorts. Built for reach and shares.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-card">
        <h2>E-commerce & Digital</h2>
        <div class="stat-tags">
          <span class="stat-tag">3x ROAS avg.</span>
          <span class="stat-tag pink">-40% CPA</span>
          <span class="stat-tag orange">2.5x CTR lift</span>
        </div>
        <p style="color:var(--color-muted);font-size:15px;margin-top:12px;">Performance-optimized UGC ads for DTC, SaaS, and service brands. Tested, iterated, and scaled.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Process Framework -->
  <section class="process-section">
    <h2 class="section-title">Our UGC Production Process</h2>
    <div class="process-grid">
      <div class="process-step">
        <div class="step-num">1</div>
        <h3>UGC Sourcing</h3>
        <p>We find creators from our 600+ database who match your brand, audience, and budget.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="process-step">
        <div class="step-num">2</div>
        <h3>Creators Matching</h3>
        <p>Review profiles, past work, and audience fit. You approve the final roster before we begin.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="process-step">
        <div class="step-num">3</div>
        <h3>Scripts & Briefs</h3>
        <p>We write hooks, scripts, and shot lists tailored to your campaign goals and platform formats.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="process-step">
        <div class="step-num">4</div>
        <h3>Video Editing</h3>
        <p>Professional post-production: cuts, captions, sound design, and format optimization per channel.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="process-step">
        <div class="step-num">5</div>
        <h3>Delivery</h3>
        <p>Final assets delivered in all required formats with naming conventions, ready to upload.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Expected Results -->
  <section class="stats-section">
    <h2 class="section-title">Expected Results</h2>
    <div class="features-grid">
      <div class="feature-card">
        <h3>Higher ROAS</h3>
        <p>UGC ads consistently outperform polished brand ads. Expect 2-5x return on ad spend from day one.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <h3>Lower CPA</h3>
        <p>Authentic creator content reduces cost per acquisition by 30-50% compared to traditional creative.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <h3>Faster Iteration</h3>
        <p>Our pipeline lets you test 10-30 variations per month. Find winners fast, scale what works.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <h3>Cross-Platform Reach</h3>
        <p>One shoot, multiple formats. Repurpose across TikTok, Meta, YouTube, and organic channels.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="contact-section">
    <div class="contact-inner">
      <h2>Discuss your case</h2>
      <p>Schedule a call to talk through your goals, audience, and content needs. We'll share relevant cases and recommend the right approach.</p>
      <div class="contact-buttons">
        <a href="https://calendly.com/okad-agency/30min" class="btn" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Schedule a call</a>
        <a href="mailto:olga@okad.agency" class="contact-btn">Email us</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Base>
